10
00:00:14,466 --> 00:00:16,380
What if you invested that one hundred

11
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:18,657
dollars every single month for twenty years?

12
00:00:18,837 --> 00:00:21,304
Today we're going to find out exactly

13
00:00:21,304 --> 00:00:22,370
what it becomes,

14
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:23,370
with real math,

15
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:25,437
and why such a small number can

16
00:00:25,437 --> 00:00:27,103
quietly change your life.

17
00:00:27,454 --> 00:00:28,545
Here's the headline.

18
00:00:28,725 --> 00:00:31,044
One hundred dollars a month for twenty

19
